<view class="detail-page page-with-fixed-bar">
  <state-view
    status="{{loading ? 'loading' : error ? 'error' : 'idle'}}"
    error-text="{{error}}"
    bind:retry="onRetry"
  ></state-view>

  <block wx:if="{{postTitle}}">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">{{postTitle}}</view>
      <view class="card-desc">发布者：{{postAuthor}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="section">
      <view class="form-item">
        <text class="form-label">留言内容<text class="required">*</text></text>
        <textarea
          class="form-textarea"
          value="{{message}}"
          maxlength="300"
          placeholder="请简单说明你希望交流的内容或能够提供的资源……"
          bindinput="onMessageInput"
        ></textarea>
        <text class="form-hint">6–300 字。内容会随合作意向发送给发布者。</text>
      </view>
      <text class="form-error" wx:if="{{submitError}}">{{submitError}}</text>
      <view class="notice-box">
        表达合作意向后，会生成一条联系申请，等待发布者确认。发布者接受前，双方不会互相看到联系方式。
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view class="fixed-bar" wx:if="{{postTitle && !success}}">
    <button class="btn-main btn-block" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="onSubmit">
      {{submitting ? '提交中…' : '提交合作意向'}}
    </button>
  </view>
</view>
